{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "92954a26f491e09ed83aca30ce58957cca252a5df8b711c022d46c58ee4ae69e", "ja": "おーい、出てこ～い。……あれ？\nここにもいないぞ。どこに行っちゃったのかな……？", "zh": "喂～快出来～\n……咦？也没有在这里耶，到底跑去哪了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6dbe786e1a4687fd589f0a7ec0f9093487e9e8945c0fcb6ac9c47228ec5aeda5", "ja": "どうしたんだ？　環。\n何か探し物か？", "zh": "环，你怎么了？\n在找东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "03ef431fc273c5a170460cece03e1ea86ea9860c456f1557fbf83fb85906019d", "ja": "あ、おやぶん！　あのね、\nたまきのトカゲが逃げちゃったんだ。", "zh": "啊，老大！\n跟你说喔，环的蜥蜴逃跑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1003_p", "source_sha256": "740598ec404f34f114f491c5b227cda2cb62187504338fbb5300db94222125ae", "ja": "トカゲ……？\nトカゲを事務室に連れてきてたのか……。", "zh": "蜥蜴……？\n你把蜥蜴带到事务室来了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "1451957b0be1cdf8542c5fe14a44f65b6e30c49fdd3ea99888e8f8913519f6d3", "ja": "うん！　たまきが、次にやるお仕事があるでしょ？\nえっと、なんだっけ……さら……。", "zh": "嗯！环之后不是有一件工作要做吗？\n呃～叫什么来着……火精灵沙罗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "3d7c0c5188a8e51ff8a1f377d92f13df488a43cdef57bbe72eb5901c4840702f", "ja": "あ、サラマンダー！\nサラマンダーって、おっきなトカゲなんでしょ？", "zh": "啊，火精灵沙罗曼达！\n沙罗曼达是很大的蜥蜴对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "9d8337bb397d01d6136b7c72ad153f2cfe901d0fca4e5c3f7c96cabd31dc0599", "ja": "だからたまき、トカゲの観察しようと思って、\n公園で捕まえてきたんだけど……。", "zh": "所以环想说来观察一下蜥蜴，\n就在公园抓了一只……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6edba905fb958d52184836e376fc745fafbddf87fcd176e69d99eac9503761c6", "ja": "そうか、環なりに仕事のことを\n真剣に考えてくれたんだな……偉いぞ、環！", "zh": "这样啊，环用自己的方式认真为工作着想……\n很了不起喔，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d69824f30600b5fe4ecbc2bcd42190b9707eee3ff69a7d853c195da3b0122e06", "ja": "でも、次から劇場に生き物を連れてくる時は、\n前もって話してほしいな。", "zh": "不过，希望你下次要把动物带进剧场的时候，\n可以事前说一声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "32fcf3c20bd41beb153daa825b3e741d4793a0f7d9fbbcd92432a6295885e8e5", "ja": "うん、わかった！\nたまき、約束するぞ！", "zh": "嗯，环知道了！\n环答应老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0122_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "62fccd918cc835944930390eda79f8cf0e5083356b86e20bd6f2c5b1f0db948b", "ja": "それにしても、どこに行っちゃったんだろ……？\nお～い、トカゲ～。出てこ～い。", "zh": "话说回来，牠到底跑去哪里了……？\n喂～蜥蜴～快出来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
